---
layout: page
---
{% comment %}
  Renders `page.profile_sections`, a list of sections. Each section has a `title`
  plus any combination of:
    profiles:    photo + bio entries (see _includes/people_profiles.liquid)
    people:      a plain name / affiliation list (see _includes/people_list.liquid)
    subsections: nested { title, profiles | people } groups
  Subsections take either shape too, so a group can be photo entries (current
  members) or a plain list (past members) as needed.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="post">
  <article>
    {% for section in page.profile_sections %}
      <h2 class="people-section">{{ section.title }}</h2>

      {% if section.profiles %}
        {% include people_profiles.liquid profiles=section.profiles %}
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.people %}
        {% include people_list.liquid people=section.people %}
      {% endif %}

      {% for subsection in section.subsections %}
        <h3 class="people-subsection">{{ subsection.title }}</h3>
        {% if subsection.profiles %}
          {% include people_profiles.liquid profiles=subsection.profiles %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if subsection.people %}
          {% include people_list.liquid people=subsection.people %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
  </article>
</div>
